<title>POLAND: WEDEL Q1 NET JUMPS TO PLN 8.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>WEDEL Q1 NET JUMPS TO PLN 8.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wedel preliminary results for the</p>
<p>first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    14.19   vs     5.05</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			15.46   vs     6.70</p>
<p>    net profit			     8.89   vs     3.62</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: E.Wedel Zaklady Przemyslu</p>
<p>Cukierniczego SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			    176.09   vs   152.01</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     114.71   vs   104.88</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.00   vs     0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     6.57   vs     3.08</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.96   vs     2.38</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.70   vs     0.73</p>
<p>    investment			    26.53   vs     7.37</p>
